<title>AUSTRALIA: CRICKET-WEST INDIES 387-4 AT CLOSE V AUSTRALIA.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-WEST INDIES 387-4 AT CLOSE V AUSTRALIA.</headline>
<dateline>PERTH, Australia 1996-11-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>West Indies were 387 for</p>
<p>four wickets at close of play in reply to Western Australia's</p>
<p>first innings total of 293 for six on the second day of their</p>
<p>three-day match against Western Australia on Saturday.</p>
<p>Scores: Western Australia 293-6 declared (Adam Gilchrist 108</p>
<p>not out, Mark Lavender 51); West Indies 387-4 (Shivnarine</p>
<p>Chanderpaul 123 retired hurt, Robert Samuels 96, Carl Hooper 84)</p>
</text>
